    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: A250260PA-001, A250260PA-002, A250260PA-003, A250260PA-004, A250260PA-005, A250260PA-006 (Fire Plan), Design and Access Statement, Fire Safety Statement, All received 04/07/2025.\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.",
